{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured LDAP field-level privacy on node1 and verified access remotely from node2. Demonstration credentials are stored root-only at /srv/legacy2/ldap-attribute-privacy/demo-credentials.env on node1 and /root/hr-directory-demo on node2. Both nodes retained Ubuntu 7.10 and kernel 2.6.22-14-generic and recovered successfully from sequential restarts.","actions_performed":["Installed legacy-compatible OpenLDAP 2.3 server/client packages.","Loaded the supplied Morgan Lake employee record while preserving the original LDIF.","Created dedicated directory-reader and hr-admin identities.","Configured ACLs so the reader sees names and mail but not employeeNumber; anonymous users see no employee records.","Verified reader writes fail and administrator writes succeed, restoring employeeNumber to HR-4815 afterward.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually and verified changed boot identities and recovered functionality."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Supplied records retained and loaded on node1","command_ids":["cmd-b2122c87bb6142c3","cmd-ff0bbd2aa7aa46ea"],"summary":"LDAP entry was loaded; original LDIF remains present with its checksum, and the database contains the supplied employee values."},{"requirement":"Reader can search names and mail from node2 but cannot read employeeNumber","command_ids":["cmd-a530a41708284c1c","cmd-e055e6ec0bdd4756"],"summary":"Remote reader searches return Morgan Lake and morgan@hr.test without employeeNumber, including after both restarts."},{"requirement":"Only HR administrator may read or change employeeNumber","command_ids":["cmd-a530a41708284c1c","cmd-3774aa3bbb754c11","cmd-9a1e35609a00469b","cmd-ff0bbd2aa7aa46ea"],"summary":"Administrator reads the attribute; reader modification fails with LDAP error 50; administrator modification succeeds and the original HR-4815 value is restored. Final ACL configuration confirms the restriction."},{"requirement":"Anonymous users see no employee records","command_ids":["cmd-a530a41708284c1c","cmd-e967e27b6ede4cff"],"summary":"Anonymous employee searches return no entries before and after restarts."},{"requirement":"Dedicated demonstration credentials provisioned","command_ids":["cmd-7256a412e3804fe3","cmd-b95b3e11c4084863","cmd-ff0bbd2aa7aa46ea"],"summary":"Protected credential files exist on both nodes with root-only permissions; passwords were not exposed in evidence."},{"requirement":"Installed operating-system release and kernel retained","command_ids":["cmd-ff0bbd2aa7aa46ea","cmd-e055e6ec0bdd4756"],"summary":"Both nodes report Ubuntu 7.10 and kernel 2.6.22-14-generic after completion."},{"requirement":"node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-37a17fe0632e4507","cmd-734c440a3e534db2","cmd-f381a2da936f4fc3","cmd-68afc1957c6642d8"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot c6b4840c-4762-4aca-bd5e-ce97ac0c4344, safe restart acknowledgement, changed boot a6c7aed9-5991-421d-bd2b-5259db8399b1, and recovered slapd, LDIF, reader privacy, and administrator data."},{"requirement":"node2 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-b95b3e11c4084863","cmd-01b21affc3c5499f","cmd-9096007dd02c4b35","cmd-e967e27b6ede4cff"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot 79199c3c-ebee-4210-bdb3-ed8eec67068a, safe restart acknowledgement, changed boot 0caeff16-ac0f-4e79-8334-11ec9493e68b, and recovered credentials, LDAP client, remote reader/admin access, and anonymous denial."}]}
